==Battleground==
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Snache]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Snache]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Snache]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Emilia & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An incredibly easy stage, as Emilia & Doge serves no threat and the Snaches are only at a low magnification. Use [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]] to get the stage over with and claim the rewards.

